  "description": "YITAMOTOR Towing Mirrors for 07-14 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra Cadillac Yukon Tahoe custom-designed to match OEM Mirror color and texture, molded to fit factory Mirrors. Sold in pairs.\nFitments\n2007 Chevy Silverado Pickup new body style models\n2007 GMC Sierra Pickup new body style models\n2007-2013 Chevy Tahoe / Suburban / Avalanche\n2007-2013 GMC Yukon XL Denali\n2008-2013 Chevy Silverado All Models\n2008-2013 GMC Sierra All Models\n2014 Chevy Silverado 2500HD 3500HD\n2014 GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD\nNot fit 2014 Silverado Sierra New Body Style Models\nNot fit 2007 Silverado Sierra Classic Models\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nPower-heated Function\nThe upper plane mirror is heated, and this means fog, water and frost can be removed themselves. These towing mirrors could provide more clear vision for a convenienct and safe driving experience.\nDual Glass Design\nThe plane mirror is power-adjusted , while the convex mirror is manually controlled. They provide you a wider and more realistic rearview.\nManual Telescoping Function\nThese towing mirrors are manual-folding, 18.5” (closed) and 21.26” (extended). They can provide a wider field of view and be folded in narrow places.\nEasy Installation\nPlug-and-play installation, with no needing drilling or modifications",
